              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obworaabaga noonoga ebijuma eby'emizabbibbu yawe, olekege okubimarraho kimu, olekehoga eby'okukonyera: abanyamahanga, enfuuzi, n'abafakati; ",
          "type": "text",
